From 400eb9f2d8666938ad69079ec50d126b4f22dd92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grafici patch export <patch-export@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:49:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add selectable Float16 storage and typed plotting families

Prerequisite: apply patches/correctness/01-spline-fixes.patch to original
575ef29 first. Spline bounds and autoscaling are consolidated there; this
precision patch builds on both fixes and preserves their implementation.

Add portable IEEE 754 binary16 storage with round-to-nearest/ties-to-even,
FP32 computation and explicit storage-rounding boundaries. Keep float as
the default API while exposing typed source, window, display and plotter
families. DataCast bridges source families without a copied sample buffer.
Signed values and results above one remain supported; FP16 is not UNORM16.

Document compact-array and full-pipeline selection, provide an FP16 sketch,
and extend regression coverage to binary16 encodings, rounding intervals,
typed plotting and the existing spline bounds/autoscale checks. Solver
workspace remains FP32; retained samples and coefficients can use FP16.
